    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stripe New Sale → Sheet + Telegram\nLogs every Stripe sale to a Google Sheet and sends a 💰 notification to your phone via Telegram.\n\n### Setup\n1. Add a **Stripe** credential and select it on the trigger.\n2. Create a sheet tab named **Sales** with the headers in `sheet-Sales.csv`; paste the sheet ID into **Config**.\n3. Telegram: message @BotFather → `/newbot` → copy the token into a **Telegram** credential. Then message your bot, open `https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates` and copy your `chat.id` into **Config → telegramChatId**.\n4. Pick your **Google Sheets** and **Telegram** credentials, then **Activate** (n8n registers the Stripe webhook automatically).\n\nFull guide: README.md in this workflow's folder.",
        "height": 438,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 7
      },
